@startuml
!theme materia
title RTP Status Update Cancel Flow (sync) — POST /rtps/status-update/cancel
actor "**Client**" as CLIENT
participant "**MS-SENDER**\n(rtp-sender-v2)" as SENDER
database "**RTPS**\n(MongoDB)" as MONGO
database "**Service Registry**\n(Azure Blob Storage)" as SR
participant "**OAuth2 Provider**" as OAUTH
participant "**Sidecar**\n(sidecar-epc-proxy)" as SIDECAR
participant "**EPC SP**" as EPC
database "**Azure Data Explorer**\n(SRTP)" as ADX
autonumber "<b>[0]"

CLIENT -> SENDER: **POST** /rtps/status-update/cancel \n(bodyRequest: resourceId)
activate SENDER

SENDER -> MONGO: find Rtp by resourceId
activate MONGO

alt **RTP Found**
  MONGO --> SENDER: Rtp
  deactivate MONGO

  alt **RTP in state RFC_SENT**

    SENDER -> SR: retrieve service provider data
    activate SR

    alt **SP Found**
      SR --> SENDER: SP data
      deactivate SR

      opt **[OAUTH2] oauth2 field present in TSP config**
        SENDER -> OAUTH: request OAuth2 token
        activate OAUTH
        OAUTH --> SENDER: access token
        deactivate OAUTH
      end

      loop **retry up to 3 times (backoff) only if Sidecar is unreachable**
        SENDER -> SIDECAR: **POST** /proxy/v1/status-update/cancel/{resourceId}
        activate SIDECAR
      end

      SIDECAR -> EPC: POST /sepa-request-to-pay-requests/{id}/cancellation-requests/{id}/status-update
      activate EPC
      note right of SIDECAR
        The RTP resourceId is used for both path params:
        the RfC is identified by the client-assigned RTP id
      end note

      alt **[200 OK] Success Cases**
        alt **[SUCCESS — FINAL] 200 with reason AEXR / RCAR**
          EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (Rsn: AEXR | RCAR)
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode)
          deactivate SIDECAR
          note right of SENDER
            AEXR → **EXPIRED** (from RFC_SENT)
            RCAR → **CANCELLED_REJECTED** (from RFC_SENT)
          end note

          loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
            SENDER -> ADX: save RTP record (final **state**) + RTP events
            activate ADX
            ADX --> SENDER: confirm
            deactivate ADX
          end

          loop **retry on error (exhausted → error propagated)**
            SENDER -> MONGO: delete RTP record
            activate MONGO
            MONGO --> SENDER: confirm delete
            deactivate MONGO
          end

        else **[RFC NOT RECEIVED] 200 with reason RCNR**
          EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (Rsn: RCNR)
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200 (reasonCode: RCNR)
          deactivate SIDECAR
          SENDER -> MONGO: triggerRfcNotReceived → **state** unchanged: **RFC_SENT**
          activate MONGO
          MONGO --> SENDER: updated
          deactivate MONGO
          note right of SENDER
            RFC_SENT → RFC_SENT
            RFC_NOT_RECEIVED event recorded in the RTP history
          end note

        else **[NO TRANSITION] 200 with reason RCPR, or no reason**
          EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (RCPR | no reason)
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --> SENDER: 200
          deactivate SIDECAR
          note right of SENDER
            State unchanged, nothing written to the DB.
            RCPR → RfC already received and processed by the SP
            No reason (empty body or {}) → outcome comes later
            through the async callback
          end note
        end

        SENDER --> CLIENT: **200 OK** (resourceId, reason)
        note right of SENDER
          **200 OK Cases:**
          - Reason AEXR / RCAR (Final states saved to ADX & deleted from MONGO)
          - Reason RCNR (RFC_SENT kept, RFC_NOT_RECEIVED event saved to MONGO)
          - Reason RCPR or no reason (No transition / async callback)
        end note

      else **[422 Unprocessable Entity] Client Error Cases**
        alt **[UNKNOWN REASON] unrecognised reason code**
          EPC --> SIDECAR: 200 (unknown Rsn)
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 200 (unknown reasonCode)
          deactivate SIDECAR
        else **[NON-CONFORMANT] 200 with a body missing CxlStsRsnInf.Rsn**
          EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: 200 (non-conformant response)
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 422
          deactivate SIDECAR
        else **[NON-CONFORMANT] 4xx with empty or unreadable body**
          EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: 4xx
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 4xx
          deactivate SIDECAR
        else **[REJECTED by SP] 4xx**
          EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: 4xx (errorBody)
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 4xx (error body)
          deactivate SIDECAR
        end

        SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **422 Unprocessable Entity**
        note right of SENDER
          **422 Cases (RTP left as-is):**
          - Service Provider invalid response (Unknown reason / Non-conformant response)
          - Service Provider rejection
        end note

      else **[500 Internal Server Error] Server Error Cases**
        alt **[SERVER ERROR] 5xx / Sidecar unreachable / EPC timeout**
          EPC --[#red]> SIDECAR: 5xx
          deactivate EPC
          SIDECAR --[#red]> SENDER: 5xx
          deactivate SIDECAR
        end

        SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **500 Internal Server Error**
        note right of SENDER
          **500 Cases (RTP left as-is):**
          - Service Provider 5xx error / timeout
          - Sidecar unreachable after retries
        end note
      end

    else **[SP NOT FOUND] Provider not in registry**
      SR --[#red]> SENDER: not found
      deactivate SR
      SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **500 Internal Server Error**
      note right of SENDER: Provider not found in Service Registry
    end

  else **[INVALID STATE] RTP not in state RFC_SENT**
    SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **422 Unprocessable Entity**
    note right of SENDER
      Invalid status transition: no RfC pending for this RTP.
      No call is made to the Service Provider
    end note
  end

else **[NOT FOUND] RTP not in DB**
  MONGO --[#red]> SENDER: empty
  deactivate MONGO
  SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **404 Not Found**

else **[INVALID REQUEST] Malformed request**
  SENDER --[#red]> CLIENT: **400 Bad Request**
  deactivate SENDER
end
@enduml
